<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK NOV NET FLAT AT PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK NOV NET FLAT AT PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.60 vs    0.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.80 vs    1.45</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 14.73 vs    7.85</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	26.43 vs   16.31</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 20.03 vs    9.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   37.31 vs   19.86</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		134.29 vs   82.39</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     224.91 vs  158.28</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
